      192.57,
      203.93,
      371.13,
      228.59
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE PARLIAMENTARY ELECTIONSACT, NO. 1 OF 1981",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      244.13,
      401.91,
      268.79
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      284.33,
      401.89,
      308.99
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Parliamentary Elections(Amendment) Act, No. of 2022.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      324.53,
      401.88,
      376.07
    ],
    "text": "2.The following new section is inserted immediatelyafter section 15 (8) (c) of the Parliamentary Elections Act,No. 1 of 1981 and shall have effect as section 15 (9) in thePrincipal Enactment:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      168.93,
      391.49,
      401.9,
      483.23
    ],
    "text": "\u201c15 (9)(1) When submitting a nomination paper, eachpolitical party or independent group shallensure that not less than one fourth of the totalnumber of candidates to be nominated for theelectoral district, and not less than one fourthof the total number of candidates in the districtlist, shall be youth candidates:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      498.65,
      401.88,
      590.39
    ],
    "text": "Provided further that, the Commissioner ofElections shall, by notice published in theGazette, simultaneously with the call fornomination, specify the number of youthcandidates to be nominated on eachnomination list, in respect of eachadministrative district.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      198.57,
      605.93,
      401.88,
      670.79
    ],
    "text": "(2) For the purposes of this Clause a youth shallbe defined as an individual either male orfemale of 35 years of age or less on the day ofthe calling of elections by the ElectionsCommissioner.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      326.11,
      455.86,
      392.78
    ],
    "text": "Amendmentof section 15to theParliamentaryElectionsAct, No. 1 of1981",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      166.97,
      356.77,
      178.31
    ],
    "text": "2 Parliamentary Elections (Amendment)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      193.87,
      203.93,
      397.17,
      268.79
    ],
    "text": "(3) In the event of a failure by a political party orindependent group to fulfill the requirementsset out in Clause 15(9) (1) the said nominationpaper shall be deemed null and void and shallbe rejected by the Returning Officer.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      281.93,
      397.2,
      305.27
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      403.15,
      283.27,
      450.44,
      321.14
    ],
    "text": "Sinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
